1
00:00:00,118 --> 00:00:01,998
But the twins knew their end.

2
00:00:01,998 --> 00:00:06,038
They told two soothsayers how to
answer when the lords asked what to do

3
00:00:06,038 --> 00:00:10,878
with their bones: grind them like
maize, and scatter them in the river.

4
00:00:11,058 --> 00:00:12,998
The lords built an oven.

5
00:00:13,258 --> 00:00:16,518
The twins embraced and
threw themselves in.

6
00:00:17,058 --> 00:00:19,078
The lords did as they were told.

7
00:00:19,518 --> 00:00:22,258
But the bones sank to
the bottom of the river,

8
00:00:22,298 --> 00:00:25,358
and on the fifth day two fish-men rose.

9
00:00:25,838 --> 00:00:29,378
Then two ragged wanderers
appeared and danced.

10
00:00:29,558 --> 00:00:32,178
They burned a house and made it whole.

11
00:00:32,358 --> 00:00:35,238
They sacrificed each other, and rose.

12
00:00:35,418 --> 00:00:37,238
The lords were delighted.

13
00:00:37,338 --> 00:00:39,598
"Do the same to us," they said.

14
00:00:39,918 --> 00:00:42,238
The twins killed the two chief lords,

15
00:00:42,398 --> 00:00:46,238
One Death and Seven Death,
and did not bring them back.
